# ThreadSanitizer suppressions.
#
# The distro libgrpc/libgpr are NOT built with -fsanitize=thread, so TSan cannot see the
# synchronisation gRPC performs internally and reports false races on its own epoll state.
# These suppressions are deliberately narrow: they match only gRPC's event-engine poller
# symbols. We do NOT use `called_from_lib:libgrpc`, because our service handlers run on gRPC
# threads and every race in them would then be hidden too.
race:grpc_event_engine::posix_engine::Epoll1Poller
